<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5: </span>
Depth estimation error metrics on the nuScenes validation set. The best results denoted in <span id="S4.F6.fig1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>. Abs Rel is used as the primary evaluation metric.
</figcaption>
