<div id="A4.SS3.SSS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS3.SSS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">To improve computational efficiency, we use a resolution of <math id="A4.SS3.SSS2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="180\times 320" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>180</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>320</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">180\times 320</annotation></semantics></math> for depth and feature rasterization, as well as for Gaussian point initialization.</p>
